1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Grandpa, Ellen, Philip, Robbie, you and me.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,665
That's six steaks.

3
00:00:08,665 --> 00:00:11,100
Don't forget Susan.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,477
Seven steaks.

5
00:00:14,477 --> 00:00:18,200
Cooking dinner for the entire family is not so easy.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,000
The shopping: the salad:

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,100
tomatoes, lettuce, cucumbers, and onions.

8
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:33,500
The main course: steak and potatoes.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,800
Richard, how much broccoli do I need for seven people?

10
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,900
Marilyn, I have to tell you something.

11
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,779
At today's exercise class...

12
00:00:43,779 --> 00:00:47,238
Yes, Richard.

13
00:00:47,238 --> 00:00:53,900
Well, I didn't really exercise.

14
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:54,100
I knew it!

15
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:57,500
I wanted to, but Jack Davis needed a photographer.

16
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,200
I'm sorry, Marilyn.

17
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:02,000
I don't understand. Did you exercise or not?

18
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
No. Instead of exercising, I photographed the class.

19
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
And you didn't exercise?

20
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,500
No.

21
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:17,000
There's another advanced class today at four o'clock.

22
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
We'll go together.

23
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,578
What about the bet?

24
00:01:19,578 --> 00:01:28,300
Oh, the bet is still on, but you shop for the groceries.

25
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:33,004
Remember, you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

26
00:01:33,004 --> 00:01:37,100
You win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

27
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:40,500
Including Susan.

28
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:44,900
Four o'clock at the advanced exercise class. With me.

29
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:45,200
Don't forget to breathe.

30
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,900
Skip, hop, front.

31
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:47,800
Twist... again.... OK, now... scissors.

32
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:51,320
This is fun. It's a piece of cake.

33
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:53,700
Yeah. Just wait.

34
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:59,900
5, 6, 7, go right, 1, 2, back,

35
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:03,443
2, 3 , 1, 2, 3, pony, pony...

36
00:02:03,443 --> 00:02:10,600
1, 2, 3, kick... 1, 2, 3, kick... pony.

37
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:13,300
And twist, twist.

38
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:16,036
OK. Let's pick up the pace.

39
00:02:16,036 --> 00:02:17,800
How are you doing, Richard?

40
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:27,300
I can barely move.

41
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:33,000
2, 3, 4, front. Now we're going to run it off.

42
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,700
Front... knees up, knees up.

43
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:38,600
OK. Finish off by jogging in place.

44
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,300
OK. Keep those knees up.

45
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:42,500
All right. That's it for today.

46
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:45,300
Thank you, everyone. See you next week.

47
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:48,200
Thank you, Jack, but no thank you.

48
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:53,452
The advanced exercise class is not so easy, huh?

49
00:02:53,452 --> 00:03:01,000
No, no, you were right. I was wrong.

50
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,300
Come on, Richard. Get up. Let's go.

51
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:07,466
You have to cook dinner for the entire family.

52
00:03:07,466 --> 00:03:12,600
Marilyn, I'm exhausted. I can't move.

53
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,700
Oh, you'll do it. It's a piece of cake.

54
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:19,167
Excuse me, Richard, Marilyn.

55
00:03:19,167 --> 00:03:21,400
You are a terrific instructor, Jack.

56
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:24,214
Thanks. But I have a question.

57
00:03:24,214 --> 00:03:27,300
Is this your very first advanced aerobics class?

58
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:30,036
Yes, it is.

59
00:03:30,036 --> 00:03:32,500
You are in great shape, Richard.

60
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:33,700
Very few people last in this class

61
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:38,600
for the full hour the very first time.

62
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:42,600
It's true. You are in great shape.

63
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,677
Thanks!

64
00:03:43,677 --> 00:03:46,677
I think we'll cook dinner together.
